description_text:
INFORMATION:

  - THIS ELECTRIC SAW IS DIFFERENTIATED FROM THE CLASSICS

  - THIS MODEL HAS BEEN MADE FOR GAMES;

  - IT WAS PRODUCED IN ZBRUSH 4R6;

  - YOU CAN USE IT IN YOUR GAME;

  - SHE COMES IN FORMAT FBX AND OBJ;

TEXTURE:
  - THE TEXTURE IS A BLADE, IRON IRON; YELLOW PLASTIC, AND IRON WITH GREASE;

Features:
Optimized and clean topology is represented by triangles;Created as close as possible to the original prototype;The structure of the model allows you to create animations;Lights, cameras, animations and render/scene setup are NOT included;Materials may look different depending on your lighting setup and the render engine;After importing the model and the textures into the target engine you have to follow the official engine documentation on how to set the material up;
Textures are 4k non-overlapping UVdetailed for closeup shots
